                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "There's been a lot of misinformation about the impacts the One, Big, Beautiful Bill will have on hospitals in Kentucky. Our @HouseCommerce bill will strengthen Medicaid for those who need it most.\n\u00a0\nSkeptical? Take a listen to what @KYHospitals have to say about our plan. https://t.co/WaIMPzyyYO",
