                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Every year, nearly 200,000 Americans are diagnosed with a blood cancer, like Leukemia or Lymphoma. Today, I met with advocates from @LLSusa from Kentucky to discuss the work @HouseCommerce is doing to support Leukemia and Lymphoma patients. https://t.co/MtEDYlnURz",
